- Floyd!

1606
01:05:10.071 --> 01:05:11.002
- Hey, bro.
- Brothers.

1607
01:05:11.138 --> 01:05:12.137
It's so good to see you.

1608
01:05:12.272 --> 01:05:13.770
We would have been here sooner,

1609
