"reserved for BroZone."

1613
01:05:19.744 --> 01:05:21.415
Didn't that seem
a little sus to you?

1614
01:05:21.550 --> 01:05:23.248
- Oh, so it's my fault?
-  Oh, look.

1615
01:05:23.383 --> 01:05:25.282
