1642
01:06:58.111 --> 01:07:00.014
Yeah.

1643
01:07:00.149 --> 01:07:03.249
Poppy, she... she's my sister.

1644
01:07:03.385 --> 01:07:05.381
You're Poppy's sister?

1645
01:07:05.516 --> 01:07:07.682
That makes us best friends, too.

1646
