1683
01:08:41.146 --> 01:08:43.110
You don't know what you're
talking about, troll.

1684
01:08:43.245 --> 01:08:44.848
You're stealing BroZone's talent
because you have

1685
01:08:44.983 --> 01:08:48.522
none of your own, you big...
oh, you big phonies!

1686
01:08:54.595 --> 01:08:57.497
Okay, we need to leave
right now.

1687
01:09:00.470 --> 01:09:02.733
" playing)

1688
01:09:02.868 --> 01:09:05.439
- Follow that luxury vehicle!
